# Preserve bytes exactly.
#
# Two contracts in this repository depend on the bytes on disk, not on the text:
#
#   * `cli/tests/fixtures/golden/` is the byte-for-byte acceptance face for the Rust port
#     (`test_golden.py` compares generated documents to the committed files), and those files are
#     written in text mode, so on Windows they are CRLF;
#   * `cli/bin/airoot.cmd` must stay CRLF, or `cmd.exe` splits its `rem` lines into commands.
#
# The tree already mixes CRLF and LF, so `text=auto` would rewrite half of it on the first commit and
# make a fresh clone differ from the working tree. Disabling conversion for everything is the only
# policy under which "the corpus reproduces exactly" is true for every clone.
* -text
